  "notes": [
    "Briarwake now has continuous tall 3D hedges with layered leaves, branches and overhead vines, plus dense drifting mist at eye height and a low-quality fog fallback.",
    "Garden footsteps use recorded grass, softer dirt and wood surfaces instead of metallic impacts. Player noise detection and the existing reduced footstep volume are preserved.",
    "All four survivors have reworked walking, jogging, running, crouching and equipment carrying, with calibrated strides, planted feet, heel/toe movement, weight shifts and smoother remote-player motion.",
    "Briarwake hiding sheds have hinged doors and animated entry/exit. A narrow eye slit provides a restricted outside view while hidden. Multiplayer friends see the transition; blocked exits are handled safely.",
    "Locomotion, all four difficulty routes, hiding transitions and four-player co-op were checked locally in the native Godot build. Separate-household playtesting is still valuable.",
    "Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in the party should install 0.23.20 before testing together. Existing settings are preserved."
  ],
